      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are a few draft options for your memo to the board.\n\nAdopting a more aggressive, impact-focused stance on ESG is a strategic imperative that directly supports long-term value creation, moving beyond the limitations of pure short-term gain. This shift is crucial for building brand loyalty and attracting a new generation of investment capital that is increasingly prioritizing strong ethical and environmental performance.\n\nFurthermore, leading in proactive ESG is a powerful risk-mitigation strategy, helping the company anticipate and adapt to evolving global regulations and the growing societal need for sustainable business practices. This forward-leaning position can unlock both competitive advantage and superior resilience in the face of market and climate-related headwinds.",
      "source": "target",
